GR-BC includes LeRobot code from the Hugging Face LeRobot project,
https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot, licensed under Apache-2.0.
Original copyright and license headers are retained in the source files.

The bundled implementation is based on LeRobot package version 0.4.4 with
GR-BC training integration. See docs/ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS.md for upstream credits.

GR-BC uses the MCR representation described in Robots Pre-Train Robots:
Manipulation-Centric Robotic Representation from Large-Scale Robot Datasets,
https://github.com/luccachiang/robots-pretrain-robots.
No MCR or VLA checkpoints are redistributed in this repository.
